  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "AoE damage and perform ritual inflicting debuffs on affected enemies",
    "skill1": "Passive: designate rear ally bond granting crit; Active: shield both",
    "skill2": "frontal arc knock down",
    "skill3": "battle damage taken reduction",
    "skill4": "bonded ally casting ultimate triggers AoE damage and Phys and Magic DEF reduction on all enemies",
    "skill5": "passive HP regeneration while bonded ally is alive"
  },
  "play_overview": "[[Thador]] designates a **rear ally bond** that grants Crit, then shields both partners when his active skill fires. His ultimate deals AoE damage and ritual debuffs across the affected line. A frontal arc skill knocks down nearby foes, while battle damage-taken reduction keeps this frontliner standing. When the bonded ally casts an ultimate, [[Thador]] triggers AoE damage plus Phys DEF and Magic DEF reduction on all enemies. HP regeneration continues while the bonded ally lives, so the kit needs a reliable rear partner to realize its shielding, Crit, and debuff payoff.",
  "counter_overview": "[[Thador]]'s rear ally bond grants Crit and shared shields, then triggers team-wide Phys DEF and Magic DEF reduction when that partner ultimates. Kill or delay the bonded carry before that payoff instead of focusing [[Thador]] alone. Priority-delete the partner with [[filter:backline-assassin]] like [[Ravion]] or inhibit it with [[filter:backline-inhibit]] like [[Bonnie]], and use [[Lily May]] for [[Thador]]'s own ultimate if it is the win button. Race your carry with [[filter:energy-provider]] like [[Hugin]] or [[Rowan]]."
}
